## Goal
`FUZZER=evomaster` makes `run_pilot.sh` (and therefore `run_batch.sh` and the E5 `run_pair.sh` path) run EvoMaster black-box instead of Schemathesis.
- Same SUT compose, same mitmproxy full-log capture, same JaCoCo, same run layout.
- Existing analysis (`analyse_run.sh`, conformance, attribute) must work unchanged on `exchanges.jsonl`.
- **When `FUZZER` is unset or `schemathesis`, behaviour and argv are byte-identical to today.**

## Facts (Claude, verified 2026-11-14)
- **Image:** pulled and present locally (do not pull):
  - `webfuzzing/evomaster@sha256:de1f4387e809a309a4c61517f3340c3d0b733b78bbb86d0e3ebd217d343515ab`
  - Version label v6.2.0, revision efad6f2bd7ff0025852a6203d307303c568e763a.
  - Entrypoint `["java","-Xmx4G","-jar","evomaster.jar","--runningInDocker","true"]`.
